        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-21T17:58:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just an opinion question here – When’s the best time to get Forced Deployment, do you think?</p>\n<p>I had it come out as the first card, which was nice in that the trash was empty, but was a nasty way to start the game, as all of the heroes ended up taking 8pts of damage in the first two rounds and a couple people took around 12.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:40.385Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
